    {
      "id": 98140,
      "title": "Launch: Vector Legal™ - AI-native law firm + software for Startups",
      "tagline": "Experienced counsel + AI agents, integrated seamlessly into your workflows so your Startup can close deals quickly and affordably. ",
      "body": "#### Startups know the stakes - it’s move fast or die. Your lawyers should operate at the same pace, without costing an arm and a leg.\n\nVector Legal combines experienced startup legal professionals + proprietary AI to help you close your deals, quickly, at startup-friendly prices. They serve clients from Seed through Series B, handling financings, IP protection, customer contracts, hiring, founder transitions, and more. \n\nIn addition: their VectorOS platform helps founders:\n\n* manage equity and dilution,\n* draft documents,\n* review contracts with AI,\n* maintain investor-ready data rooms, and\n* ask questions across their legal docs.\n\nThe team brings deep experience in the space, having previously worked at Fenwick, YC Legal, and Ironclad.\n\nIf you’re a U.S. startup looking for a modern law firm, learn more and book a demo at[ **https://vectorlegal.com**](https://vectorlegal.com)\n\nCongrats on the launch, Keenan and Mitch 🚀",
      "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/PWu-launch-vector-legal-ai-native-law-firm-software-for-startups",
      "votes": 5,
